  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>From the given word,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi></math>.</p><p>Number of alike letter pairs&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Number of ways to select one pair<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>2</mn></mmultiscripts></math></p><p>Number of distinct letters<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>Number of ways to select two distinct letters<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts></math></p><p>Number of ways to arrange four letters&nbsp;if&nbsp;two are alike<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Required number of ways&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>2</mn></mmultiscripts><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>24</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>240</mn></math></p>",
